WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.881 --> 00:00:05.728
Prudential has been

00:00:05.728 --> 00:00:09.101
fully committed to long-term protection planning for savings policy customers for more than 170 years

00:00:10.106 --> 00:00:13.718
Prudential proactively discloses policy returns to stand the test of time

00:00:13.718 --> 00:00:16.000
S&amp;P global rating upgraded to AA Working

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
with the world's top investment partners, using its local advantages!

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Local advantage?  What does it mean?

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.721
Just like drinking milk tea, you need

00:00:25.721 --> 00:00:28.212
to find a gold medal master to make it!

00:00:28.212 --> 00:00:30.000
He needs to be familiar with the tastes of the neighbors

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.654
in order to brew a fragrant, rich and smooth authentic gold medal milk tea

00:00:35.654 --> 00:00:40.393
so when you find the right master, half the battle!

00:00:40.393 --> 00:00:44.137
In the same way, our investment partners must be familiar with the local market to

00:00:44.137 --> 00:00:48.093
fight for long-term and robust returns for our participating policy clients

00:00:48.093 --> 00:00:51.596
Understand!  Please have a cup of golden milk tea!

